# LF in every checkout, on every OS: fixtures round-trip byte for byte, generated files
# (docs/COMMANDS.md, app/src/lib/ops.gen.ts, …) are compared with their source, and tests search
# fixture text for "\n"-terminated lines.
* text=auto eol=lf

# CRLF on purpose: a fuzz seed for CRLF input, and Microsoft's licence file kept as published.
fuzz/seeds/tmsl/alphabetical_crlf.bim -text
reference/samples/microsoft/LICENSE -text

# Binary formats (git detects most of these; listed so no heuristic touches them).
*.pbix binary
*.pbit binary
*.abf binary
*.vpax binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.bin binary
